    "sections": {
        "description": "Prime Tutor Academy is a premium, feature-packed theme built for tutoring services, academic coaching, online learning platforms, virtual classrooms, homeschooling, after-school centers, and e-learning startups, supporting personalized education, skill development, and exam prep services across multiple subjects and training programs.Designed for educators, tutors, and coacher it supports math, science, English, coding, and test prep, with a responsive layout, tutor profiles, course listings, schedules, booking tools, and Contact Form 7 integration. With SEO-friendly design, payment support, CTAs, and social connectivity, this e-learning theme helps educators grow a professional online presence with e-learning optimization system. It is ideal for academies, tutoring franchises, and digital education hubs using structured learning systems and e-learning tools for better student engagement. Prime Tutor Academy theme ensures flexibility, scalability, and modern learning experience for every coacher platform."
    },
